INPUT_PARAMETERS
suffix              SIC_RELAX
calculation         cell-relax
ecutwfc             100
dft_functional      pbe
basis_type          lcao
ks_solver           genelpa
nspin               1
smearing_method     gauss
smearing_sigma      0.01
scf_nmax            200
scf_thr             1e-7
relax_nmax           100
force_thr_ev         0.005
stress_thr           0.5
out_stru             1
